{
  "title": "DevShop CI/CD & Deployment Health",
  "uid": "devshop-ci-cd",
  "version": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 40,
  "tags": ["devshop", "ci-cd", "deployment"],
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### CI/CD & Deployment Health\n\nThis dashboard shows the **deployed state** visible from Kubernetes itself (image tags, rollout/availability, pod age).\n\nJenkins runs the CI pipeline (builds images, pushes to Docker Hub, and writes the desired image tag back to Git). **Argo CD** syncs Kubernetes from Git. Neither Jenkins nor Argo CD currently expose Prometheus metrics in this project, so there is no direct build/sync chart here yet. When a metrics exporter is added for Argo CD (`argocd_app_info`, etc.) or Jenkins, add panels to those Prometheus series. The drill path for any problem below is: Open the **Application/API** dashboard, then **Workloads**, then drill to the node via the **Infrastructure** dashboard."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Deployment / Rollout State",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Deployment Availability %",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available / kube_deployment_spec_replicas * 100)", "legendFormat": "avail %", "refId": "A", "format": "table", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 80 }, { "color": "green", "value": 100 } ] },
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "filterable": false }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Currently Deployed Image per Pod",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "kube_pod_container_info", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{image}}", "refId": "A", "format": "table", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "filterable": false } }, "overrides": [] },
      "transformations": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Rollout Stability",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod Start Time (new deployments appear as fresh lines)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "time() - kube_pod_start_time", "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Restarts since rollout",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] } }, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
